the base class updates the object in a scope: changed, v: "filled"
a closure of the base class through a helper of its module: changed, v: "handed out"
the same closure a second time: SHARED-OBJECT-ERROR, v: "handed out"
a closure of the base class through a helper of the derived class's module: SHARED-OBJECT-ERROR, v: "orig"
the tenant's closure through a helper of the base class's module: SHARED-OBJECT-ERROR, v: "orig"
a closure of the base class, run by the tenant: SHARED-OBJECT-ERROR, v: "orig"
